This repository contains the source code, design, copywriting, imagery and
personal data of the personal portfolio website of Rafael Aguiar
(https://rafaguiar.dev).

It is published publicly for the sole purposes of (a) being served as a static
website by a hosting provider and (b) allowing prospective employers and
clients to inspect the author's work.

IT IS NOT OPEN SOURCE AND IT IS NOT PLACED IN THE PUBLIC DOMAIN.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. WHAT YOU MAY DO
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

You may:

  a) view the website and read its source code, in a browser or in this
     repository;
  b) fork or clone this repository for the purpose of reading the code or
     submitting a fix back to the author;
  c) reuse small, generic technical fragments — an isolated CSS rule, a short
     helper function, a general animation technique — in your own work, as you
     would from any public code sample, without attribution and without
     permission.

